        <div class="block full FeaturedMedia">


<div class="@container ">
    <div class="flex @lg:flex-row flex-col gap-8 @lg:items-center @lg:py-8">
        <div class="min-w-full @md:min-w-[50%] @lg:max-w-[50%]">
                <img src="/siteassets/visitors/nevada-magazine.jpg" class="aspect-233/131 object-cover w-full rounded-lg" alt="Nevada Magazine - Visit Nevada" />
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col @lg:w-full">



<h2 class="title-page mb-4">Visit Nevada</h2>


                <div class="content-base">Nevada offers a mix of vibrant city life and striking natural landscapes, from the entertainment hub of Las Vegas to the scenic beauty of Lake Tahoe. Travelers can explore desert adventures, national parks, and unique attractions like Area 51, making it a diverse destination for both relaxation and exploration.</div>

                <div class="flex gap-4 items-center mt-7 flex-wrap">
                        <a href="https://travelnevada.com/"
                            class="btn btn-blue text-center @max-sm:w-fit overflow-hidden @max-sm:text-sm @max-sm:leading-[1.3125rem]">Nevada Tourism</a>
                        <a href="http://nevadamagazine.com/"
                            class="btn btn-blue text-center @max-sm:w-fit overflow-hidden @max-sm:text-sm @max-sm:leading-[1.3125rem]">Nevada Magazine</a>
                </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</div>
    
